5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the past. What happened to the last three rollouts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the budget. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about the network. Let us look at network coverage at customer plants.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the daily losses. Let us check time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is doing the work? Let us look at staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the budget is important, but history tells us what fails.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, but if the money is frozen, nothing else matters.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, copying records is annoying, but is it the biggest problem?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a measurable loss. We need data, not guesses.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, network issues affect the field. That is a real risk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also look at the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will also look at in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will also look at handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what the files say.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the numbers are clear.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I am curious what we find.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,We will judge by the facts.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
