35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The last three rollouts show a clear pattern. Daily entry tools were dropped.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Half the customer plants lose network coverage for whole afternoons.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We lose an hour daily copying records. Eleven misrouted deliveries this year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The coordination group is understaffed. Two people do all the work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, if the software allowance is open, we can fund a tool.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, but we must avoid per-head licence costs. Fixed-fee is better.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, if the network is bad, a mobile app might fail.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, the app can sync offline. The copying loss is real.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the standardization efforts failed because they had no owner.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,The narrow tools for one trade still run. We need something simple.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,A central repository could work if it is fixed-fee.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The developers are busy until the third quarter. We need an outside integrator.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The misrouted deliveries are due to duplicate addresses. A hub would fix that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The vendor queries are repetitive. A shared catalog would help.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,I think a central repository is the way to go.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree, if the cost is fixed.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I am worried about the network, but a hub is central.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The data supports a hub.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,It solves the staffing issue too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
